  "reviewNotes": [
    "This appendix is inside the congenital-pneumonia recommendation; MiniMed must retain that source context even though the appendix title states general neonatal needs.",
    "The same fluid/nutrition appendix is cross-referenced by other current neonatal recommendations, which supports concept reuse but not silent conversion to a universal treatment order.",
    "Blank/merged source cells are preserved explicitly instead of extrapolating values to missing weight groups.",
    "All values are treatment/reference ranges, not automatic prescriptions; clinical condition, renal output, enteral intake, respiratory status, losses and laboratory monitoring remain outside this compact dataset.",
    "Runtime calculator/order-set promotion is blocked pending clinician review of eligibility, phase/age boundaries, merged cells and monitoring requirements."
  ]
